## Files

Upload and download tools work on local files, on the machine that runs this
server, inside `{{.EnvPrefix}}_FILES_DIR` (default `{{.FilesDirDefault}}`).
Give paths relative to that folder. A path that leads outside it, through
`..`, an absolute path elsewhere or a symlink, is refused. File contents
never pass through MCP: the tools return the path, size and content type.
{{- end}}
