## Customizing

Don't edit the `*_gen.go` files, `main.go` or `go.mod`; `har2mcp generate`
rewrites them. To change a tool, edit the spec and generate again. To add
tools in Go, edit `custom.go`: har2mcp creates it once and never overwrites
it.
